      "title": "How to read this workflow",
      "properties": {
        "widget_ue_connectable": {}
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 01m \u00b7 img2img + process GIF \u2014 micro model\n\nWorkflow 01 on the **2 GB micro checkpoint** (DreamShaper 8 LCM) instead of DreamShaper XL: 4 steps, `lcm` / `normal`, cfg 2.0, **denoise 0.75**, anchor scaled to 512 px on its long side. Seconds per run on a GPU.\n\n- **KSampler (capture process)** sends a preview on every step and keeps the x0 predictions.\n- **final image** is also saved to `outputs/session/<run_id>/final.png`.\n- **denoising process (GIF)** is `outputs/session/<run_id>/process.gif` (every step, 512 px, 8 fps), starting from the anchor.\n- Every run is added to `outputs/session/session.html`.\n\n**Other anchors:** change the image in *anchor 01* and set *Upscale Image* to 512\u00d7512 (anchor 1), 512\u00d7340 (anchor 2) or 340\u00d7512 (anchor 3). `run_img2img.sh` / `run_img2img.cmd` queues all three from the command line."
      ]
    }
